# SDD: Migration Harness
status: draft
authority: migration-harness

## Feedforward guides
- AGENTS.md
- SDD hierarchy
- UI contract
- language reference
- migration playbooks
- parity ledger

## Deterministic sensors
- cargo tests
- parser/AST conformance
- HTML golden/snapshot tests
- semantic DOM assertions
- token/style checks
- forbidden dependency checks
- CLI golden tests
- compose determinism
- docs example validation
- parity ledger completeness

## Behavioral sensors
- keyboard navigation
- focus behavior
- overlay dismissal
- form validation
- theme switching
- RTL
- reduced motion
- responsive behavior

## Visual sensors
Canonical screenshots for light/dark/default/focus/disabled/mobile/desktop and component-specific states.

## Rule
A failing sensor creates a corrective loop. Do not bypass or silence the sensor without changing the SDD and documenting why.
